            "name": "Travel Riddles: Trip To France",
            "steam_appid": 659940,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Have a fantastic trip to one of the most beautiful countries. Travel to France and unlock its secrets through a series of puzzles set in the capital city of Paris, amazing landscapes of Champagne and Provence, Courchevel ski resort and the jewel of French Riviera – Cannes.<br />\r\nEarn dozens of achievements, get free gold to charge the powerups, blast through challenging levels and set the best score.<br />\r\nLearn fun facts about past and present of France on every level and collect tons of artifacts and souvenirs!<br />\r\n• Uncover more than 100 artifacts<br />\r\n• Learn the secrets of France through more than 230 levels.<br />\r\n• Beautiful locations<br />\r\n• 9 unique episodes, from the capital city of Paris to Provence, Cannes and more.<br />\r\n• Set of jigsaw puzzles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour journey around the world continues! Where will your travels take you next?",
            "about_the_game": "Have a fantastic trip to one of the most beautiful countries. Travel to France and unlock its secrets through a series of puzzles set in the capital city of Paris, amazing landscapes of Champagne and Provence, Courchevel ski resort and the jewel of French Riviera – Cannes.<br />\r\nEarn dozens of achievements, get free gold to charge the powerups, blast through challenging levels and set the best score.<br />\r\nLearn fun facts about past and present of France on every level and collect tons of artifacts and souvenirs!<br />\r\n• Uncover more than 100 artifacts<br />\r\n• Learn the secrets of France through more than 230 levels.<br />\r\n• Beautiful locations<br />\r\n• 9 unique episodes, from the capital city of Paris to Provence, Cannes and more.<br />\r\n• Set of jigsaw puzzles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour journey around the world continues! Where will your travels take you next?",
            "short_description": "Travel to France and unlock its secrets through a series of puzzles set in the capital city of Paris, amazing landscapes of Champagne and Provence, Courchevel ski resort and the jewel of French Riviera – Cannes. Earn dozens of achievements, get free gold to charge the powerups, blast through challenging levels and set the best score.",
